Package: EvoTempo
Type: Package
Title: A Comprehensive Toolkit for Evaluating Temporal Signal in Phylodynamics
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Fangluan", family = "Gao", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "rainby@fafu.edu.cn")
Description: An interactive R/Shiny toolkit for evaluating temporal signal in
    measurably evolving populations. Designed for viral phylodynamicists and
    evolutionary biologists, it integrates complementary approaches for
    diagnosing temporal-genetic confounding, exploring root-to-tip temporal
    structure, performing date-randomization tests, and evaluating temporal
    signal using Bayesian model comparison. EvoTempo provides these analyses
    within a unified graphical interface, reducing the need for complex
    command-line workflows while supporting reproducible analysis and
    publication-ready visualization.
